OL,3,GNEWSAThe South West reacts to Budget
OL,4,Aannouncements
OL,5,
OL,6,FTourism and hospitality leaders have
OL,7,Fbeen reacting to this week's Budget.
OL,9,FAmong the headlines in chancellor John
OL,10,FHealey's first Budget on Wednesday were
OL,11,Fa #100 payment to help millions of
OL,12,Fhouseholds with energy bills, a VAT cut
OL,13,Fon electricity bills and a freeze on
OL,14,Ffuel duty, both extended to July.
OL,16,FIt also announced Devon would get an
OL,17,Felected mayor in 2028 white Cornwall
OL,18,Fwas included as the only area on a
OL,19,Fpathway to become a Foundation
OL,20,FStrategic Authority.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
